@startuml
title Strategy / Policy

skinparam legendBackgroundColor #f9f9f9
skinparam legendBorderColor #999999

legend right

**Intent**:
Encapsulate interchangeable algorithms; let them vary independently from clients.

**Motivation**:
Choose algorithm at runtime; avoid conditional logic.

**Applicability**:
Algorithm families; avoid conditional logic; runtime selection.

**Participants**:
Context uses Strategy; Strategy encapsulates algorithm.

**Consequences**:
Pros: Replace algorithms easily; test independently.
Cons: More objects; clients must know/select strategies.

**Implementation Notes**:
Configure via DI; expose simple selection API.

**Known Uses**:
Java Comparator; Collections.sort with strategy.

**Related Patterns**:
State, Template Method, Factory Method.

endlegend

class Context {
  -strategy : Strategy
  +setStrategy(s: Strategy)
  +execute()
}

interface Strategy {
  +doAlgorithm()
}

class ConcreteStrategyA
class ConcreteStrategyB

Strategy <|.. ConcreteStrategyA
Strategy <|.. ConcreteStrategyB
Context o-- Strategy
@enduml